**Goal.** New ruling R2386000 (amends R1368000): `cargo jackioh winrates --refresh` is also due while the live window is short, when the table has no row CN Tech can pick for a shipped set and the input's (development-padded) table has one for every shipped set. A `crates/cards` test fails while `crates/cards/data/win_rates.json` leaves a shipped set (seven now, Training Grounds included) without one. The PR plays 600 development games, writes the refreshed provisional table and its fragment, re-blesses moved golden traces, and passes `patches check`, `spec check`, `golden check` and `classify --claims`.

**Files to touch.**

| Path | | What |
|---|---|---|
| `crates/cards/src/lib.rs` | change | new `pub fn sets_without_win_rates` |
| `crates/tools/src/winrates.rs` | change | header, `Args::refresh` doc, `Refresh::Fills`, `refresh_due`, new `fill_fragment`, `refresh`, `run`, new tests |
| `crates/cards/src/scripts/meditative/c050_cn_tech.rs` | change | two R2386000 tests in `mod m50_cn_tech` |
| `crates/cards/data/win_rates.json` | change (written by the tool) | refreshed table |
| `crates/cards/patches/pending/cn-tech-and-na-tech-read-a-win-rate-table-that-covers-every.json` | new (written by the tool) | its fragment |
| `crates/engine/tests/golden/games.jsonl` | change (only via `golden bless`) | re-blessed games |
| `spec/rulings/R2386000.md` | new | the ruling |
| `spec/rulings/R1368000.md` | change | one closing paragraph |
